[{"op":"set","target":["v","f",1108],"value":0},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",1109],"value":4},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",1110],"value":27},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",1111],"value":0},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",1112],"value":1},{"op":"background","image":"bg001"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"set","target":["v","z",312],"value":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"第二天。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我按照约定，来到了古河面包店。"},{"op":"background","image":"bg007"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「早。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"渚正独自待在店内。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng10a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「朋也君，欢迎光临。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「哈哈…你这样活像个店员啊。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「不过这也挺新鲜的，很不错啊。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng32a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「这个，怎么能说活像呢…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「哟，这个看着挺好吃的。如果你是店员的话，我就肯定买了。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng16a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「这个，朋也君。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「嗯？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「我说了，你能不生气吗。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「是出什么问题了吗？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng32a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「嗯…是这样的…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「我，今天我必须要看店了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「哎…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「那，就是说…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng31a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「是的，哪都去不了…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「真的假的…？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「对不起…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「大叔呢…？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「这个…爸爸他说偶尔也想休息一下…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「因为爸爸他之前一直在不停地工作…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「然后我就忍不住提出自己来替一班…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「………」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我用手捂着脸。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng16a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「这个，真的很对不起。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「不，没事啦…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「而且…我早就知道大叔说的话，你是不可能当耳旁风的。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「就是因为你这个样子，我才会喜欢上你啊…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"声","text":"「怎么，你小子喜欢上我家女儿了？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"…是大叔的声音。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgak20"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不知什么时候，他已经站到我身后。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我不禁僵住了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「刚才那算表白？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「不，不是的…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「哦，是朋友之间的那种喜欢啊…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgak13"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「这样啊…你算是保住了那东西。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不是保住了性命，而是保住了那东西啊…。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgak10"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「那么，你今天是来当顾客的？」"},{"op":"choice","id":"6427:18063730","target":["v","f",1089],"items":[{"text":"来当顾客","value":0,"serial":18063730},{"text":"来帮忙的","value":1,"serial":18063740}]},{"op":"ifFalse","to":114,"condition":["==",["v","f",1089],0]},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「没错，来当顾客。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgak13"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「这样啊，那你多买点回去。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「就算你不说我也会的。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng18a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「………」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"在我挑面包的过程中，渚一直用一种寂寞的目光望着我。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「结账。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng16a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「啊，好的。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"渚慌慌张张地站到柜台。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng17a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「我看看…一共３００日元。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgak14"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「渚啊，这种人不许给他打折。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng32a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「啊…被发现了吗…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「没关系，不用打折的。多少钱？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgak20"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「１万整。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「不可能的好吧。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgak14"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「被发现了吗…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng10a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「３８０日元。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我从钱包里取出５００日元硬币，递到渚手上。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「找您１２０日元。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「谢啦。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我接过装有面包的袋子，转过身去。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng32a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「多谢惠顾。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「欢迎…再次光临…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「嗯。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我就这样走出了店里。"},{"op":"background","image":"bg001"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"中间我只回了一次头。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"（既然是在店里帮忙，那也没办法啦…）"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"（要加油哦。）"},{"op":"ifFalse","to":110,"condition":["&&",["==",["v","f",17],1],["==",["v","f",18],1]]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"正当我打算去春原房间的时候，忽然想起来了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"（对啊，现在芽衣妹妹在他那儿啊…）"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我还是不要去打搅他们吧…。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我在商店街消磨完时间，就回去了。"},{"op":"goto","to":112},{"op":"ifFalse","to":112,"condition":["||",["==",["v","f",17],0],["==",["v","f",18],0]]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我转去春原房间。"},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",22],"value":1},{"op":"goto","to":800},{"op":"ifFalse","to":800,"condition":["==",["v","f",1089],1]},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「我是来帮忙的。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgak24"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「很好，那你就负责捡球吧。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「这算帮哪门子忙啊。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「我要帮渚的忙。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng13az"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「哎…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「是真的吗，朋也君？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「嗯，我们两个一起看店吧。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng22a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「那真是太好了…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgak14"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「不需要。你这样一脸麻木的人要是来看店，客人反而会减少的啊。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"既然你看店都不会减少，那我肯定没问题。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgak13"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「而且还有早苗在。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「那就让早苗阿姨也休息一下不就行了？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng23az"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「啊，这个主意真是不错。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「这样一来，妈妈也能够休息一下了。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgak19"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「你们两个人真能看好店？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「是的。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgak20"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「…这活可没那么轻松啊。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「我明白的。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgak13"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「要是踏错一步，就会没命的。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"你就吹吧。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng10az"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「没问题的，我已经习惯了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「而且，还有朋也君支援。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「嘁…你也真够死脑筋的。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「嗯，是很死脑筋。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgak14"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「明白啦，那你们干吧。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「一定要大卖特卖。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgak12"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「然后让我们面包店人气爆棚。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「每种面包销量都要破百万！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「虽然不是很明白，但我们会拼命加油的。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgak20"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「不，你就不用拼命了。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng13az"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「哎？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgak14"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「要拼命的是你小子。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「我？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「嗯。渚，你就好好使唤这小子吧。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgak13"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「你就喝着热带果汁，动动下巴指挥他就行了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「我才不会那样呢。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgak11"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「你那么可爱，就应该合理利用男人来干活啊。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「赶紧去喝热带果汁吧。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng16a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「我不喜欢那样。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「我想两个人齐心协力加油。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「嘁…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgak14"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「真是个让人搓火的小子。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「我又怎么了。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgak13"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「算了，随你们喜欢吧。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「之后就交给你们了。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng10a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「好的。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「你打算干什么去？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgak13"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「这可是女儿为我创造出的宝贵时间啊…」"},{"op":"set","target":["v","z",314],"value":1},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgak22"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「当然是去玩！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"说着，他从柜台下面取出一根金属球棒。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「你打算干什么去啊…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgak19"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「还用问吗，当然是去打棒球啊。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「你难道还会拎着一根球棒去洗澡吗？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「不会…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgak22"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「对吧？说到球棒，就只能是棒球。说到棒球，就只能是球棒啊。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"手套和球哪儿去了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「再见啦，接下来就交给你们了。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgak17"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「呀吼ーー！」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"就在我呆然的注视下，他发出一声怪叫冲出面包店。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「这是爸爸的兴趣爱好。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「嗯？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng10a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「和附近的小朋友一起打棒球。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「跟小孩打…？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「是的，小朋友可喜欢爸爸了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「哦，这样啊…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng23a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「真的太好了。他能那么高兴。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「平时他都是傍晚才能出去，今天总算能玩一整天了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「他每天都玩啊…这不就是单纯的偷懒吗…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"自己居然要为了那种人来帮忙，真是没脸见人了…。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsn10e"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"早苗","text":"「让大家久等啦。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"早苗阿姨从厨房里走了出来。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"她手中的托盘里放着刚烤出来的面包。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"那应该就是早苗阿姨原创的面包了吧。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「你好。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsn11e"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"早苗","text":"「你好呀。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"早苗","text":"「我还在想怎么外面这么热闹，原来是冈崎同学来了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「是的，而且啊，妈妈。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsn10e"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"早苗","text":"「嗯？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng17ay"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「今天妈妈也休息一下吧。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"早苗","text":"「哎？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「朋也君也来帮忙了，所以没关系的。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsn19e"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"早苗","text":"「哎，是这样的吗？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「嗯，也让我来帮忙吧。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsn15e"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"早苗","text":"「这怎么可以…不合适吧。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「没事的，我觉得这会是很棒的经历。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsn14e"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"早苗","text":"「是这样吗？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「嗯，我是真心的。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsn10e"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"早苗","text":"「这样啊…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsn11e"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"早苗","text":"「…我明白啦。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"早苗","text":"「那我就回去屋里了，要是有什么事，就来喊我。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"她把自己的面包摆放到固定的位置上。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"然后她再一次转向我们…"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsn12he"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"早苗","text":"「那么，你们要加油哦。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"她在鼓励了一下我们之后，便转进了屋里。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng32a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「话虽这么说，但爸爸妈妈都不在，实在有点紧张呢。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「不过，客人本来也不太多吧？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「是的。最忙碌的时段是早上，过了中午就不是特别辛苦了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「那我们就放轻松点吧。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng10a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「好的。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「………」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"…无事可干。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng32a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「这个…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「我去确认一下售价。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"说着，渚看向托盘上摆放着的标价牌。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"屁股冲着我。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"…目光移不开。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"（要是弯下腰…说不定可以看见…）"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「喂，我这个男朋友在想什么啊！」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng14a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「哎。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"渚回过头来。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng16az"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「吓了我一跳…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「出什么事了吗？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「不，没事…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng10a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「会不会无聊呀？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「既然是看店，抱怨这个也没意义啦。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「也是啊。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"叮铃。提示铃响了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我回过头，只见一个提着购物袋的主妇推门进来。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng25a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「欢迎光临。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「欢迎光临。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我学着渚的样子迎接客人。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"客人","text":"「你们好。今天是小年轻的店员呢。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng10a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「嗯，我是来帮忙的。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"客人","text":"「真是了不起呀。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「都已经是高中生了，这些事不算什么的。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"客人","text":"「不是的，我家那孩子就肯定做不来啊…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng23a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「谢谢惠顾。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"客人","text":"「我还会再来的。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「嗯，拜托您啦。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"终于送走第一位客人。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「你还真厉害啊。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng13a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「指的什么？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「刚才你不是操作了收银台吗。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng10a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「很简单的，只要记住价格，谁都会用的。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「找零这些事，如果不是习惯了的话，肯定没办法那么熟练。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「嗯，找零可能的确是习惯了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「一开始还需要用手指抓。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng23a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「习惯之后，就能像这样直接拈起来了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「哦…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng10a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「朋也君，要不要也来操作试试看？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「啊？我吗？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「嗯。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「我都没用过啊…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng23a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「没关系的，我来教你。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「………」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"…的确，要是这些都做不来，我就真的无事可干了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「嗯，那就拜托你了。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng10a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「好的，那你过来这边。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"渚把我请进柜台里。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"然后她拉着我的手臂，站在旁边。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng10a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「很简单的。只要把价格输入进去，然后按这个键。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「合计是按这个键。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「最后再把从顾客那收取的钱的数额输进去，再按这个。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"渚的体温通过手臂传了过来。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng30a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「然后找零的金额就会显示出来，下面的抽屉会打开，按照显示的金额给零钱就好。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"虽然渚在努力向我进行说明，但我却顾不上那些了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"（对啊…我是她男朋友啊…）"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"（现在应该堂堂正正地…）"},{"op":"choice","id":"6427:18065700","target":["v","f",1089],"items":[{"text":"搂住渚的肩","value":0,"serial":18065700},{"text":"忍住","value":1,"serial":18065710}]},{"op":"ifFalse","to":639,"condition":["==",["v","f",1089],0]},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我伸开手臂，绕过渚的背后。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"然后搂住她的肩…。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng31a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「啊…朋也君…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我们四目相对。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「渚…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"声","text":"「有人吗。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"…与此同时，门口传来人声。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"声","text":"「啊，打扰了。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng13a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「啊…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"当我们转头看向门口，那里已经没有人了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「………」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我们呆在原地。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「客人…回去了呢…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng31a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「是的…人家特地过来买面包的…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「抱歉…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「没事的，我也一时没能控制住自己…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「………」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng16a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「这个。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"忽然渚大声说到。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「我去找刚才那位客人，这里就拜托你了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「哎？你知道刚才那是谁吗？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng33a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「不知道，但我可以一个人一个人去问。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「那也太花时间了吧…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"还不等我阻止，渚已经跑了出去。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"…留下我独自一人。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"（全都是因为我鬼迷心窍…）"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这让我非常沮丧。"},{"op":"set","target":["v","z",312],"value":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"声","text":"「怎么啦？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这次是从屋里头传来声音。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsn10"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"只见早苗阿姨正好走进店里。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「不…这个…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「因为我的问题…把一个客人给吓回去了…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"早苗","text":"「然后，渚就出去找那位客人了？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「是的…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsn11"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"早苗","text":"「那还真是让人担心呢，那我也来帮忙吧。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"明明是因为我的失败，可能让店的风评变差，她却似乎完全不在乎那些事。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"于是我决定，再也不做那种傻事了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"比起责骂我一顿，她这样做效果反而要好得多。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"叮铃一声铃响，有客人进来了。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsn12he"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"早苗","text":"「欢迎光临。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"早苗阿姨立刻问候到。"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我只能在一边看着。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"…我这人还真是没用。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"此刻我深刻地感觉到了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"也不知该做些什么，只能呆呆站着。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsn14e"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"早苗","text":"「还在担心渚吗？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「不，并不是那样…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「那家伙为了挽回我的错误在努力，而我却只能呆站在这里…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsn10e"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"早苗","text":"「现在也不是很忙，所以没关系的。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「请问…我可以来操作收银台吗？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsn11he"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"早苗","text":"「好的，那就有劳你啦。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「刚才渚教过我了…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不过，她好像并没有在听…。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"哐啷。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"客人","text":"「你好。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"有新客人来了。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsn12e"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"早苗","text":"「你好，欢迎光临。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsn10e"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"早苗","text":"「那么，冈崎同学，就拜托你啦。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「哦，好的。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我赶紧站到收银台前。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"早苗阿姨正陪在客人旁边介绍面包。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"虽然只是个小小面包店，还是有点紧张啊…"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsn12e"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"早苗","text":"「就这些吗？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"客人","text":"「嗯。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsn11he"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"早苗","text":"「那我先去帮您装起来。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"早苗阿姨把盛着面包的托盘放到柜台上。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsn10e"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"早苗","text":"「这个是１６０日元。这边两个是１２０日元。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「嗯，好的。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我操作着收银台，而早苗阿姨则在一边把面包装进袋子里。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「正好４００日元。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"客人","text":"「喏，这是５００日元。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「找您１００日元。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"客人","text":"「好的，谢谢。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsn11e"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"早苗","text":"「谢谢惠顾。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"在早苗阿姨的目送下，客人离开了面包店。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"看来总算是度过了一关。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsn12he"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"早苗","text":"「很不错呢。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「不，这全要靠早苗阿姨报给我价格啊。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「我还是得赶紧背下来才行。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsn10e"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"早苗","text":"「是啊。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「另外，我也不太懂怎么取零钱。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「渚那家伙，好像能这样拈起零钱来。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsn11e"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"早苗","text":"「很简单的。我来教你吧？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「好的，拜托您了。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsn10e"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"早苗","text":"「那就失礼啦。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"早苗阿姨来到我身边。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"距离近到肩靠着肩。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsn10e"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"早苗","text":"「先看我做一遍哦。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「好，好的。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"………。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"总觉得…好紧张啊。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"仔细想来，这还是第一次和早苗阿姨两个人独处。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"而且，还是这种近距离接触。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"因为早苗阿姨看起来非常年轻，让人格外的心跳加速。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「是这样吗…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我一边注意不让她看出我心里的活动，一边有样学样，动起手来。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsn11he"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"早苗","text":"「嗯，你做的很好啊。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"叮铃。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"渚推门进来了。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng18a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「我回来了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"早苗","text":"「你回来啦。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「………」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「怎么样了？找到人了吗？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng32a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「啊，不…没能找到。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「这样啊…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsn10e"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"早苗","text":"「找了那么长时间都没有找到，那也没有办法啦。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsn11e"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"早苗","text":"「到处走也累了吧？你快休息一下吧。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng16a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「不…我完全不累。妈妈才是，快去休息吧。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"早苗","text":"「我没事的。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「妈妈，去休息一下啊。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「你在生什么气啊。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng32a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「哎？不…我才没有生气呢。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsn11e"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"早苗","text":"「嗯，我懂啦，看来是妈妈打扰到你们啦。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng31a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「啊…我不是那个意思。只是想让妈妈休息一下。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"早苗","text":"「好，那我就好好休息一下吧。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「嗯…那就太好了。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsn10e"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"早苗","text":"「那之后这里就交给你们啦。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「好。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"早苗阿姨转进屋里去了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「你怎么了？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng18a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「没怎么…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「是因为没有找到人？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「不过，那也都是我不好…你不要太苛责自己啊。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「嗯…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「不过，我倒是让早苗阿姨教会我了取零钱的手法。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng16az"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「………」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「…我还想教呢。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「哎？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng33a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「不，没什么。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「……？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"叮铃一声提示铃响，又有客人来了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"虽然还不到忙碌的程度，但一直到傍晚都不断有客人来。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我一边把渚报出价格输入收银台，一边找出零钱。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这些工作不断重复着。"},{"op":"background","image":"bg007y"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",1118],"value":6},{"op":"set","target":["v","z",313],"value":1},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgak20"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「呵…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"大叔环顾了一下店内。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgak14"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「干得还不错。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「真的吗？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgak13"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「嗯，能卖出那么多很不错了。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgak22"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「真不愧是我的女儿。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「因为朋也君也很努力帮忙了…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「真不愧是我的女儿。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng33a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「不，我才没用点点下巴指挥他呢。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng32a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「而且，我中间还离开了一段时间…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「嗯？出什么事了？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「因为出了点问题，我就出去找一个客人了…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「都说了那是我的问题。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgak10"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「那还用说。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"你明明没看见好吧…。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「不，不是的…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgak13"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「不，你永远是对的。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"都说了你又没看见，别乱插嘴。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgak20"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「不过能卖出那么多，也就无所谓了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「那就太好啦。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgak12"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「不过，你小子可要接受惩罚哦。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"…凭什么啊。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng16az"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「要是朋也君要受惩罚，我也一起受罚。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgak20"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「好，我明白了，既然你都这么说就一起领罚吧。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgak11"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「渚，你要受泡芙随便吃之刑。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgak13"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「而你小子，要受往眼睛里滴酱油之刑。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng16az"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「完全是两码事啊。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「而且往眼睛里滴酱油很危险的。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgak14"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「嘁…我开玩笑啦。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgak13"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「既然你那么努力，我就给你点奖励吧。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「给，拿着。这是你的打工钱。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不知是不是早就准备好的，他从裤袋里抽出的手上捏着钞票。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng17a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「不，这不算打工。我只是帮个忙，不要钱的。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「那就算零花钱吧。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「我有按时拿到零花钱啊。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgak19"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「你再另外拿一些也无所谓吧。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「这样不好的，零用钱规定好一个月拿一次的。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgak12"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「你要是不拿，我就拿去擦屁股了？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「不可以那么做的。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgak13"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「对吧，那就收下吧。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng32a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「不是的…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「我真的不用…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgak13"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「嘁…真是死心眼。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgak14"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「你小子总会要吧。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"大叔的目光转向了我。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「不，我也不要…毕竟添了那么多麻烦。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgak25"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「那是当然。谁要给你啊，笨蛋。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「这话听起来真火大。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「啊，妈妈来了。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsn10"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"早苗","text":"「秋生，你回来啦。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgak23"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「哦，我回来啦。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「你看，这帮小家伙，干得还不错。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsn10"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"早苗","text":"「是的，非常努力呢。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsn11"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"早苗","text":"「托他们的福，我真的好好休息了一下。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"早苗","text":"「真是太感谢了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「不，之前给妈妈添了不少麻烦…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsn12"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"早苗","text":"「别这么说。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsn10h"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"早苗","text":"「晚饭已经准备好了，冈崎同学也留下来吃吧。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「哎，妈妈，你什么时候做的呀？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsn10"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"早苗","text":"「中午就开始做啦。安下心慢慢做饭，可是非常有意思的呀。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgak10"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「话先说在前头，只要不拼创意，早苗做的饭可是天下第一好吃哦。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsn20"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"早苗","text":"「这种说法，好像我平时拼创意老是失败一样呢。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgak22"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「早苗，我喜欢你。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"你这蒙混过关的办法真是不得了！"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsn11"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"早苗","text":"「嗯，我也喜欢你啊。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsn10"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"早苗","text":"「那么，大家都进来吧。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"大叔说的没错，早苗阿姨做的奶油浓汤真是天下第一。"},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",23],"value":1},{"op":"goto","to":800},{"op":"ifFalse","to":800,"condition":["==",["v","f",1089],1]},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"忍住。毕竟是在工作。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng10a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「朋也君，你试试看取零钱吧。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"咔嚓一声，抽屉弹了出来。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「哎？我？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「嗯。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「是这样吗？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我学着渚的样子，试着用手指拈零钱。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「差一点。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"然后渚把自己的手搭到我的手上。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「用中指，像这样。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我的手指随着渚的手指一起动。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「…这样？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"嗖的一声，一枚硬币滑进我的手心。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng23a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「好，刚才这次完成的很好。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「哈哈…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"能被渚夸奖，总觉得好开心。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我真想一直就这样，在她身边让她教我。"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"客人","text":"「你好。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"然而天不遂人愿，来了位客人。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng10a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「那朋也君，收银就拜托你啦。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「嗯。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng25a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「欢迎光临。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"渚则正陪在客人旁边介绍面包。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng10a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「这些就可以了吗？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"客人","text":"「嗯。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「那我先去帮您装起来。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"渚把盛着面包的托盘放到柜台上。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng10a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「这个是１６０日元。这边两个是１２０日元。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「嗯，好的。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我操作者收银台，而渚则在一边把面包装进袋子里。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「正好４００日元。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"客人","text":"「喏，这是５００日元。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「找您１００日元。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"客人","text":"「好的，谢谢。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng23a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「谢谢惠顾。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"在渚的目送下，客人离开了面包店。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng10a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「朋也君。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"渚回过头来。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng25a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「你很有店员的样子哦。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「真的？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng23az"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「是的。因为不会叼着烟，所以比爸爸更像店员呢。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「和那个人一比的话，的确是啊…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「不过，这全要靠你报给我价格。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「我还是得赶紧背下来才行。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"叮铃一声提示铃响，又有客人来了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"虽然还不到忙碌的程度，但一直到傍晚都不断有客人来。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我一边把渚报出价格输入收银台，一边找出零钱。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这些工作不断重复着。"},{"op":"background","image":"bg007y"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",1118],"value":6},{"op":"set","target":["v","z",313],"value":1},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgak20"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「喔…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"大叔环顾了一下店内。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgak14"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「干得还不错。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「真的吗。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgak13"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「嗯，能卖出那么多很不错了。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgak22"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「真不愧是我的女儿。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「因为朋也君也很努力帮忙了…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「真不愧是我的女儿。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng33a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「不，我才没用点点下巴指挥他呢。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgak12"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「你要听指挥啊。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"…别跟我说啊。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng10az"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「我们两个人一起努力的。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgak14"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「嘁…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgak13"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「既然你那么努力，我就给你点奖励吧。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「给，拿着。这是你的打工钱。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不知是不是早就准备好的，他从裤袋里抽出的手上捏着钞票。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng17a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「不，这不算打工。我只是帮个忙，不要钱的。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「那就算零花钱吧。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「我有按时拿到零花钱啊。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgak19"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「你再另外拿一些也无所谓吧。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「这样不好的，零用钱规定好一个月拿一次的。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgak12"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「你要是不拿，我就拿去擦屁股了？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「不可以那么做的。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgak13"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「对吧，那就收下吧。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng32a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「不是的…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「我真的不用…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgak13"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「嘁…真是死心眼。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgak14"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「你小子总会要吧。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"大叔的目光转向了我。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「你要给，我就收。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgak13"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「那把手伸出来。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我依他所说伸出一只手。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgak14"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「两只手。手心朝上并在一起。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「啊？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"大叔重新把手插进裤袋里。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"然后，在双手上一撒。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"哗啦哗啦哗啦哗啦～…"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"全都是些零钱啊！"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgak10"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「怎么样，收到这么多开心吧？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「这话听起来真火大。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「啊，妈妈来了。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsn10"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"早苗","text":"「秋生，你回来啦。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgak23"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「哦，我回来啦。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「你看，这帮小家伙，干得还不错。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsn10"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"早苗","text":"「是的，非常努力呢。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"早苗","text":"「托他们的福，我真的好好休息了一下。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsn11"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"早苗","text":"「真的谢谢你。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「那真是太好了。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsn10h"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"早苗","text":"「晚饭已经准备好了，冈崎同学也留下来吃吧。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「哎，妈妈，你什么时候做的呀？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsn10"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"早苗","text":"「中午就开始做啦。安下心慢慢做饭，可是非常有意思的呀。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgak10"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「话先说在前头，只要不拼创意，早苗做的饭可是天下第一好吃哦。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsn20"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"早苗","text":"「这种说法，好像我平时拼创意老是失败一样呢。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgak22"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「早苗…我喜欢你。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"你这蒙混过关的办法真是不得了！"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsn11"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"早苗","text":"「嗯，我也喜欢你啊。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsn10"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"早苗","text":"「那么，大家都进来吧。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"大叔说的没错，早苗阿姨做的奶油浓汤真是天下第一。"},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",1118],"value":0},{"op":"background","image":"kuro"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"jumpScene","scene":6428,"entry":0},{"op":"return"}]